Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.53,0:00:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,that Mario Pasteur might\Nshoot a movie in one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.65,0:00:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,of our three daraufmanners\Nmight get proven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Why, Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,SHAPIT!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,YUN!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.35,0:00:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.01,0:01:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had enough suffering\Nand you want to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.69,0:01:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again, Gensly. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only 500 life points\Naway from Annihilation anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been in tougher spots before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now make your move. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Rainbow Snake in Ghana.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It could wipe him out\Nright now with one strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But what fun would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to drag this duel out a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's see. Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Melkin, the four-faced\Nbeast, in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.07,0:01:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My first order of business is to take\Ndown your obnoxious Celtic Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My four-faced beast should\Nhave enough power to crush
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.49,0:01:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it and take a bite out of your\Nlife points in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.65,0:01:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the four-faced beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:02:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Eliminate his obnoxious Celtic\NGuardian with quadruple smash attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, this is definitely not my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I going to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This virtual world is supposed\Nto be a total illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't touch those flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So why does my face hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this place is a\Nlittle too real for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the other guys\Nare better off than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.73,0:03:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Had enough, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.61,0:03:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,With your face in the dirt and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta hang in there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever you are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Never. Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I have lifepoints, it's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more foolish than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.05,0:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the most inexperienced people in the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,business world know when\Nit's time to close shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters all that much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lifepoint account will\Nbe empty soon enough, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll escape to the real world at\Nlast, once I take over your scrawny body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And it all happens when\NI launch my next attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have 400 life points left!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.37,0:03:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as Gansly has at\Nleast two monsters on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,he can activate Reflector Hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,bouncing all my attacks back at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has now come for you to make\Nyour final move of our virtual game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll seal this deal once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving your inferior mind\Ntrapped here in my place forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have all the time in the world to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Contemplate the grim horror\Nof your future. Sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,like fun right all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,right here goes a rainbow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,blessing magic card\Nthat's not gonna help me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,now I need something\Npowerful if I'm going to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat Gansley well? Stalling\Nwon't help you success.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,comes to men of action\Nno one You never got
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,ahead in the corporate\Nworld by just waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That only leads to defeat,\Nwhich is where you're headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think people call\Nyou the king of games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If only those folks in the real\Nworld could see you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.23,0:05:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to concentrate on this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Karibo's trying to tell us that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rainbow Blessing may be\Nable to help after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I had faith in my Deckmaster, so\Nnow it's time to put that to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this duel on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You suits are wasting my\Ntime, so show your faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're\Ngetting ready for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet I'm the main course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get out of here,\Nor I'll be Taya Soup! Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can I get all the way up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A penguin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've officially lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look down! Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold on much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is more\Ndangerous than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah has accessed virtual software that\Ncan replicate the sensation of touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can hear me, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with\Nthis, you little twerp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have so much to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.39,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we had the latest\Nvirtual software, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But this place feels way\Nmore real than any cyber
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,environment I've ever\Nseen in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.15,0:07:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't grabbed my arm, who\Nknows what would have happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of game Noah's\Nplaying, but it's not Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That punk, he doesn't\Nknow who he's up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.21,0:07:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you see\Nfrom this point forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to realize The past is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and I may not be proud of every\Ndecision I made But everything I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I did for us So we'd have a better life\NNow let's move ahead And don't look back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling the worst is yet to come
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, the end is near, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.21,0:08:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This will do nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my magic card,\NOfferings to the Doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Its effect allows me to destroy any\Nmonster on your side of the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.09,0:08:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to Chimera, your\Nlast line of defense, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All your monsters are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Rob, you forgot about the special\Nability of my mythical beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I can bring back one of the\Nmonsters I used to form my beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The end result will be the\Nsame once I play this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Wall of\NIllusion and milked the four
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:09:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-faced beast to summon\NRainbow Snake and Garner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, mighty serpent, put the bite on\NBurfomet, and the squeeze on Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your defensive monster, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's a bit too late,\Nbut here's some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.31,0:09:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The next time you decide to swim with\Nthe big fish, pack a life jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're sinking\Nfast, not that there's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,going to be a next time\Nsoon you'll be trapped here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.61,0:09:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm saved the question is who is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,saving me guess i'll find out soon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm busted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for my finishing move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, your life points\Nhave finally expired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And who better to deliver the final\Nblow than my favorite reptilian beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruklomba, the spirit king,\Nfree me from this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.81,0:10:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,By striking Yugi down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's through. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.43,0:10:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to destroy his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.35,0:10:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job, Karibo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it that you're still standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life point should be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My Deckmaster saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his special ability,\NKaribo formed a protective wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, why have you taken over for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.51,0:11:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I just figured you could use a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, to recover from\Nall those direct attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One more blast could have\Ndestroyed you, so I jumped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You should thank Karibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.87,0:11:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Without his special ability, we both\Nwould have been finished by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Some things are more powerful\Nthan they first appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba turned out to be the most valuable\Nmonster on our side of the field. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,getting him as our\Ndeckmaster wasn't just some
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,trick that Gansley played\Non us in order to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the heart of the cards\Nthat guided Karibo to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel has affected you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Gansley, this duel's not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your furry little Powderpuff blocks\None attack and you think you've won?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid nothing could be further from\Nthe truth, thanks to the Deckmaster rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've activated\NKaiba to defend yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you've introduced him\Nto the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I'm now allowed to\Nattack your little furball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.99,0:12:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And according to the Deckmaster rulebook,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,if your Deckmaster is\Ndestroyed, you lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.61,0:12:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And your Karibo is no match for\Nmy Serpent, so this duel is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, it was still on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:12:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those one-eyed freaks are still coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This does not look good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So now what? They have me cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but that virtual bridge couldn't hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.07,0:13:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,okay that is not a small drop and\Nthis thing's not looking too sturdy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but if I don't go,\NI'm Cyclops Chowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure could use my\Nfriends right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.25,0:14:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We formed a bond of friendship that\Ncan't be broken, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.49,0:14:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're never really\Napart from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel them cheering me on,\Nso it's time for me to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Put one foot in front of the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.71,0:14:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, just pick up the pace a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're halfway home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.75,0:14:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You freaks, stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way this bridge can support us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.55,0:14:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.33,0:15:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just hope those\Nfellas won't be back anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've had about\Nenough of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Man-eating cyclops freaks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Collapsing bridges? No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your final pathetic move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.99,0:15:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that you have any options.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.07,0:15:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All you've got left is your puny Kuribo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And what can he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Karibo can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He came through once,\Nand he can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You like to do a lot of talking, Gansly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to give the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Misjudging the power of the small can be a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,big mistake in business\Nand in Doom Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they never taught you that\Non your way up the corporate ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So Karibo and I will just have to\Nteach you this lesson the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.79,0:16:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,by eliminating you from this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.63,0:16:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, based on your own twisted rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be trapped in\Nthis world for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what card you just drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.43,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Swift Gaia the Fierce Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.19,0:16:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember my special ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me with whatever monster you\Nlike, and it still won't affect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just reflect the attack back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,With only 400 life points to\Nspare, you'll wipe yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the magic card, Rainbow Blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When this card is combined with\NKaribu, a great power is released.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.83,0:17:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect to win with\Nrainbows and fuzzballs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of stunt is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Karibo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.55,0:17:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Form the Rainbow Arch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.99,0:17:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should check\Nyour Deckmaster rulebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I shall summon Swift Gaia\Nthe Fierce Knight in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, to put you out\Nof business, Gansley!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your monsters are not my targets\NI'm aiming directly for your life points
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I analyzed every aspect of this tool Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:18:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you seem to have missed this one\NNow, my fierce knight, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the path of the Rainbow Arch and\Nattack his life points directly. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.81,0:18:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,this can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My Death Master ability doesn't\Nwork on direct attacks! Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Karibo, I was able\Nto figure out your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be crushed by the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close to winning your body and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving this virtual\Nnightmare behind for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that's over\Nwith, at least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to find our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what kind of\Ndanger Noah may have put them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Karibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Yugi was stronger\Nthan I thought Impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the Big Five\Ndon't really have the dueling
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.41,0:19:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,skills they claimed to have\Nwhen I hired them. We'll just
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.99,0:19:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,have to see how well the others\Nfare in the coming duels, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.99,0:19:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a passageway. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We might find the gang. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully that's where it leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friends could be in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope we're not too late.
